+## TDAI Host Routing
+
+Load this package with `skill_view`. If the manifest points to a supporting file, read that file with `skill_files_read`; do not install or execute source-repository dependencies for Task 1.
+
+Use when:
+- Writing E2E tests with Playwright
+- Setting up browser-test infrastructure, page objects, fixtures, reporters, CI integration, API mocking, or visual regression testing
+- Debugging flaky browser tests
+
+Do not use when:
+- Do not use waitForTimeout() when proper waits are available
+- Do not rely on CSS class selectors
+- Do not share state between tests
+- Do not ignore flaky tests
+- Do not use first() or nth() without good reason
+
+The upstream technical workflow below is preserved unchanged.
